csrc/ contains unchanged sources and their header dependencies from vLLM
commit 5df63a7203cdb9328d824a27b682e77c7b9928be (v0.32.0):
https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/tree/5df63a7203cdb9328d824a27b682e77c7b9928be/csrc

These implement prefill per-row selection and cooperative/persistent decode
selection. LICENSE.vllm retains the Apache-2.0 license. Flare supplies separate
operator registration and a preparation-only build, preserving the reference
launchers and kernels without importing the vLLM serving runtime.

The BF16 selection wrapper loads a separately built vllm-project/DeepSelect
library exposing torch.ops.deep_select.topk. Qualification uses the revision
selected by vLLM v0.32.0, d96d33afe1fab0d6066da49cdc91e64c2bee65ea:
https://github.com/vllm-project/DeepSelect/tree/d96d33afe1fab0d6066da49cdc91e64c2bee65ea
DeepSelect source and binaries are not carried in this directory.
